    "winLossStreak": {
      "declared": {
        "streakBonusCap": 5,
        "winGoldPvP": 1,
        "winGoldWithLeadersCrest": 5
      },
      "formula": "After each PvP fight: draw -> streak unchanged; result equal to the previous non-draw PvP result -> streak += 1; otherwise streak = 0 (also for the first PvP result). Income bonus = min(5, streak) after PvP rounds. So the bonus is 0 for the first result of a run, 1 for the second consecutive identical result, ..., 5 for the sixth or later.",
      "tracedBehavior": "Wins AND losses both build the streak (a loss streak pays the same bonus as a win streak). Draws neither reset nor extend it and are skipped when looking for the 'previous' result. PvE fights neither update nor reset it, and a PvE round's income omits the streak bonus. Separately, a PvP win pays +1 gold (5 with the opponent's LEADERS_CREST) at the end of the fight; losses and draws pay none.",
